INSERT OR REPLACE INTO cms_items (c_id, i_id, title, pic, content, addtime) VALUES (67, 201, 'Standard Wax Ribbon', '../upload/image/20181226/20181226150105_20901.jpg', '<p></p><p>Standard Wax Ribbon <br/> Introduction:<br/> with excellent anti-static property and outstanding print quality,have the good print quality and the better label adaptability by using the high property printer and the simplified tabletop printer. The print speed can be up to 6 ips. It is suitable for many different types of label stocks. Premium wax has longer storage time, the better product stability, excellent heat resistance and abrasion, making the printer picture much more durable, clear and smooth.<br/> Print material:<br/> Recommended substrates:<br/> Art paper, coated paper, uncoated paper, glossy &amp; semi glossy paper, hangtag:<br/> Feature:<br/> 1.Extensive label adaptability<br/> 2.Good stability of products<br/> 3.High definition<br/> 4.Low print energy can extend the life of protect print head<br/> 5.Anti-static back coating can protect print head effectively.<br/> Technical parameters:<br/> Test Item Unit Test Equipment Standard<br/> Total thickness U m Thickness Tester 7.0+0.3<br/> Ink thickness U m Thickness Tester 2.6+0.4<br/> Electrostatic K v Static Tester 0.06<br/> Optical density D Transmission Type Density Spectrometer 1.3<br/> Color density D B Reflex density spectrometer 2.6<br/> Glossiness Gs Vancometer 51<br/> Application field:<br/> Price Label, Product Identification Label, Hang Tag, Packing Label, Train Tickets, Shipping &amp; Receiving Label, Logistical Label.</p> <p><br/></p>', '2026-09-06 20:58:45');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO cms_items (c_id, i_id, title, pic, content, addtime) VALUES (67, 183, 'Printer Ribbons (date tape ribbons)', '../upload/image/20181226/20181226150049_14575.jpg', '<p></p><p>Printer Ribbons (date tape ribbons)</p> <p>Tape for dates (date tape,opening tape,thermal transfer color ribbon,PET thermal transfer opening ribbons,TAPE FOR DATES) were also called as thermal transfer color tape/ribbons,hot coding foil, hot ink roller.It was used as the footprint of BOPP/PET/CPP/PVC/PE/POF/TAPE film. This tape type it production date and shelf life of products. tape for dates includes opening tape,thermal transfer color ribbon,thermal transfer color tape,hot coding foil, date tapeshot ink roller,hot transfer film, thermal transfer ribbon, Printer Supplies,Printer Ribbons<br/> Thickness: 8.5,10.9-21.5-33.5-55UM (microns) . <br/> Width: 20mm,25mm,30mm,35mm,40mm,50mm,100mm,110mm, and so forth. <br/> Length: 100m,150m,200m,250m,360m,500m,1000m,<br/> Color: black,red,blue,yellow,white...<br/> Packing:24,36,72,100pieces/carton Quantity: 5000cartons/hour</p>', '2026-09-06 20:58:45');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO cms_items (c_id, i_id, title, pic, content, addtime) VALUES (67, 175, 'Self adhesive labels in rolls', '../upload/image/20181226/20181226151133_76448.jpg', '<p></p><p>Self adhesive labels in rolls</p> <p>we manufacture all kinds of Coated paper material self-adhesive labels in rolls, <br/> 1.) material:80G semi-glossy coated paper, color: white, non-printed . coated glue and self-adhesive size:80G*32MM*40MM (three pieces per line) ,5000pieces/roll 16rolls/carton<br/> 2.) Self-adhesive labels, Coated paper material self-adhesive label, material:80G semi-glossy coated paper, coated glue and self-adhesive size:80G*50MM*70MM (two pieces per line) ,2000pieces/roll 16rolls/carton<br/> 3.) Self Labels - Semi Gloss - 100mm x 70 mm - 1000 pieces/roll <br/> 4.) Barcode printer (Fight Code Machine),High-speed printer for printing declaration such as: Datamax DMX-E-4304B (without Ethernet interface),Datamax DMX-E-4204B (without Ethernet interface),Zebra GT810 200dpi (with/have Ethernet interface)<br/> 5.) all kinds of self adhesive label in difference materials.</p> <p></p><div style="color:#008000;font-family:Calibri;background-color:#FFFFFF;font-size:14px;"> Coated paper labels are commonly used materials for barcode printers to print labels, and their thickness is generally around 80g. It is a very common printing material in the packaging and printing industry. It is a high-grade printing paper made of base paper coated with white paint. The surface of the paper is smooth and the whiteness is high. After packaging and printing processing, delicate and clear patterns can be obtained. and text, generally divided into ordinary coated paper and mirror coated paper </div> <div style="color:#008000;font-family:Calibri;background-color:#FFFFFF;font-size:14px;"> Product features: semi-gloss white coated paper, basic weight 80g/square meter, surface substrate thickness 72um, overall label thickness 147um, use temperature range -50~+90 degrees, low labeling temperature +7 degrees </div> <div style="color:#008000;font-family:Calibri;background-color:#FFFFFF;font-size:14px;"> Scope of application: Widely used in supermarkets, inventory management, clothing tags, industrial production lines, suitable for promotion and semi-gloss color printing in industry. Typical applications such as cosmetic labels, drug labels and food industry labels. Can be attached to most substrates Flat and simple curved surfaces, including cardboard, plastic film. </div> <div style="color:#008000;font-family:Calibri;background-color:#FFFFFF;font-size:14px;"> Product features: smooth and bright white coated paper with polished surface, basic weight 80g/square meter, overall label thickness 165um, use temperature range -50~+90 degrees, low labeling temperature +7 degrees </div> <div style="color:#008000;font-family:Calibri;background-color:#FFFFFF;font-size:14px;"> Scope of application: Widely used in high-gloss color label printing, typical applications such as cosmetic labels, pharmaceutical labels, food labels and promotional labels, etc. Can be applied to flat and simple curved surfaces of most substrates, including cardboard, plastic film and HDPE containers. </div>', '2026-09-06 20:58:45');
